+\subsection{Frozen diagnostics and reproduced failures}
+
+All seven whole-document runs abstained. The two scanned final terms yielded
+no extracted clauses; the two BES bases left 17 and one unresolved records;
+the lease, RMBS and regional-health securitisations left two, five and four,
+respectively. The total is 29 unresolved records, with no runtime errors.
+These counts describe the bounded reader, not legal completeness or a failure
+rate in a representative population.
+
+The three clause probes also abstained, but their internal classification
+discarded unpaid-cancellation language as cancellation after redemption or
+repurchase. The independent regression screen checks the original passages
+and requires those clauses to remain recognised as unpaid loss or unresolved
+meaning. It fails on all three, as intended for these preserved defects.
+A passing integrity check therefore coexists with a failing interpretation
+screen. Exception-preserving interpretation would require more than this
+minimum screen.
+
+From this worktree the retained results can be checked with:
+\begin{lstlisting}
+python3 -m scripts.run_prospectus_corner_tests verify
+python3 -m scripts.check_prospectus_corner_findings
+\end{lstlisting}
+The first command verifies hashes and the recorded run. The second exits
+with status 1 while the three known clause defects remain. Neither command
+makes network requests or modifies the frozen reader.
+
